{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又附白牛頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱廣印，號聞谷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱圓修，號天隱。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱海明，號破山，嗣法天童。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱通微"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱通賢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱通琇，繼住報恩。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱通問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱通際"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱妙用，號玄微。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱明海，號香幢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "徐諱昌治，號覲周。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱寂暹"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師諱寂暹"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "白牛在西，面西；童子在東，面東。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "主人問牛所在，童子茫然失措。更有一人自西而來，以手遙指。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "童子向西急走，田中多見牛跡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "白牛穩臥田中，童子遙見歡喜。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "白牛從容起立，童子喜，撫其背。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "童子閒坐石上，白牛飲㵎自適。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "夕陽在山，白牛歸宿，童跨牛背，吹笛自樂。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明月在天，牧童拍手自歌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人牛俱不見，惟一圓相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "童子向東前行，白牛相隨在後。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0777001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0777001", "type": "orig", "text": "普明禪師牧牛圖頌既出仍畧干茲"}
